<title>UZBEKISTAN: Uzbek Q1 industry output rises 4.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Uzbek Q1 industry output rises 4.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uzbekistan's industrial output was 4.2 percent higher in January-March this year than in the same period last year, the macroeconomics and statistics ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>    UZBEK INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	  Jan-Mar '97	Jan-Mar '96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	     +4.2		 +0.8</p>
<p>--Tashkent Newsroom, +7 3712 361958</p>
</text>
